  "editorialSummary": "Nothing says modern governance quite like [Binance users withdrawing billions](https://oglobo.globo.com/economia/noticia/2026/11/02/binance-registra-quase-us-5-bi-en-retiradas-desde-retomada-dos-saques-apos-ataque-hacker.ghtml) after a heist while [Poland's political crisis deepens](https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/02/world/europe/russia-polish-political-turmoil.html) and [German riots erupt](https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/2/german-unions-launch-wave-of-strikes-over-cost-of-living-pressures?traffic_source=rss) over grocery tabs. At least the researchers extracting [dinosaur blood cells](https://www.newscientist.com/article/2596881-dinosaur-red-blood-cells-recovered-from-115-million-year-old-fossil/?utm_campaign=RSS%7CNSNS&utm_content=home&utm_medium=RSS&utm_source=NSNS) finally have a logical blueprint for how much more draining this species can get.",
